<h3>Welcome to the Middlesex County College Digital Collections</h3>

<p>This digital library (MCCDL)&nbsp;for Middlesex County College houses&nbsp;both the scholarly and creative&nbsp;output of faculty and students&nbsp;as well as the historical materials of the College held in the College Archives.</p>

<h2>Historical Collections</h2>

<p>Historical materials encompass&nbsp;the College&#39;s Annual Reports,&nbsp;Board of Trustees meeting minutes, yearbooks, photographs, and other resources related to the history of the College.</p>

